candidate_text:
Position: credit risk / investment / financial analyst / manager
Moreinfo: 10+ years experience in credit and financial analysis of companies in different industries;
Financial and investment modeling experience, NPV, IRR;
P&L, BS, CF forecasting and projections creation;
Markets analysis and research;
Banks relations - accounts opening, financing, etc.
Efficient team player with international, multicultural experience and team-management skills;
Looking For: To join a team of professionals, where I can share my experience to bring better financial performance and improve risk management processes for the company.
English Level: fluent
Experience Years: 10.0
CV: 10+ years experience in credit and financial analysis of companies in different industries;
Financial and investment modeling experience, NPV, IRR;
P&L, BS, CF forecasting and projections creation;
Markets analysis and research;
Banks relations - accounts opening, financing, etc.
Efficient team player with international, multicultural experience and team-management skills;
To join a team of professionals, where I can share my experience to bring better financial performance and improve risk management processes for the company.

