CV:
10+ years experience in credit and financial analysis of companies in different industries;
Financial and investment modeling experience, NPV, IRR;
P&L, BS, CF forecasting and projections creation;
Markets analysis and research;
Banks relations - accounts opening, financing, etc.
Efficient team player with international, multicultural experience and team-management skills;
To join a team of professionals, where I can share my experience to bring better financial performance and improve risk management processes for the company.

Moreinfo:
More than 10+ years of experience in finances on a leading position as a CFO and Manager of FP&A/Accountant departments. Chartered certified professional with combined experience in multinational information/financial technology companies.
 Hold an associate membership of the Institute of Financial Accountants (UK) & Institute of Public Accountants (AU). Highly skilled in financial analysis, financial reporting, management accounting, corporate finance, budgeting and strategic planning. 
Passionate for building strong and effective teams, optimizing business processes, providing financial support and producing strategic recommendations and providing high quality services to a key business stakeholders. Experienced as a Project Manager of SAP implementation (4 years), BAS ERP(1C) implementation with integration to Corp/Bank/CRM systems for UA legal entities. Standardization, automatization and optimization of processes within responsibility ‘own’ and “drive” the process design from start to finish.
Chartered Accountant with an engrained understanding of accounting standards under IFRS, US GAAP and UA GAAP. 

Key Specialties:
• Financial Controlling, Reporting & Analysis;
• Budgeting & Forecasting;
• Management Reporting;
• Auditing & Investigation;
• Financial Software Implementation (SAP, 1C BAS, Tableau & Power BI tools, Zoho CRM system)

candidate_text:
Position: CFO
Moreinfo: Summary:
Detail-oriented CFO with 7 years of experience dedicated to spearheading financial growth through careful financial planning and cost-cutting initiatives. Strong qualifications in developing and implementing financial controls and processes in addition to productivity improvements. Possesses solid leadership, communication, and interpersonal skills to establish rapport with all levels of staff and management.

Duration: Apr 2019 - Feb 2020
Role: Senior Finance Manager
Project description: Product IT-company.
Responsibilities:
- Preparation and consolidation of financial statements in QuickBooks & Fathom;  
- Financial Reporting & Budgeting, burn rate and runway calculation;
- Management of the company’s bank accounts (US, Chase);  
- US & UA Payroll management;  
- Development of the accounting policy and internal policies (equipment, business trips, FOPs, etc.) for the company; 

Duration: Dec 2016 – Mar 2019
Role: CFO
Project description: Software development company.
Responsibilities:
- the implementation of management accounting from the scratch: Balance, Cash Flow, and P&L;
- as the only financier: day-to-day cash flow management, internal reporting, all accounting and treasury activities;
- prepare financial data for USA tax and valuation advisers;
- as a member of the management team prepare data for Strategic Planning.
Looking For: Professional growth. Adequate management. Informal environment. Challenges. Interesting projects.
Highlights: Overall 10 years of Financial Management experience in different areas including Finance, Sales & E-Marketing.
Knowledge of Financial Management & Management Accounting.
MBA: Professional Diploma in Management – Dip Mgmt (Open) (2013).
Accounting Certification: Certified Accounting Practitioner – CAP (2010), CIMA – in progress (2019). 
Experience of the implementation of management accounting from the scratch: Balance, Cash Flow and P&L. Able to analytic work within the constraints of resources and time, to manage risk of projects.
