Position: Corporate Lawyer
Moreinfo: Hi, I am Vladyslav, a lawyer with over three years of experience in IT projects support. A significant amount of them are B2C projects, during the support of which I used to: 
- find solutions for acquiring payments from users and for transactions to subcontractors, opening bank accounts for the flow between holding companies and their subsidiaries;
- arrange issue of operation permits and licenses;
- draft and review agreements NDA, MSA, S&P, Rent, Lease, Agent, Loan, Investment and others;
- conduct legal researches and resolving day-to-day issues;
- prepare tax planning;
- manage documents workflow.
Looking For: No personal participation in judical proceedings.
