Moreinfo: 01/03/2012-16/04/2021 - Director of LLC "......" Law Firm (Kyiv, Ukraine):
In general, the company focused on foreign clients, of which approximately 90% of the total number were companies and individuals of the Republic of Turkey. Various tasks from the entry of a foreign company to the market of Ukraine with subsequent full legal support to the reverse until the liquidation of such a legal entity in Ukraine, contractual processes, claim-lawsuit work, immigration processes, etc.
Directly participated in:
- development of external economic contracts, agreements on the provision of services, sales, leases, loans, NDA, and other contracts, analysis of agreements provided by counterparties, making changes to them, drawing up a protocol of disagreements, etc.;
- carried out an assessment of the legal prospects of the defense in relation to the violated right, collected the necessary evidence, prepared documents for the parties to the litigation, and represented interests in the judicial bodies;
- obtaining permits for employment of foreign citizens in Ukraine, permits for immigration of foreign workers to Ukraine, obtaining permits for temporary/permanent residence in Ukraine;
- providing support during inspections by controlling bodies
- support of corporate issues (registration/liquidation of individuals and legal entities, registration/liquidation of a representative office of a foreign company in Ukraine, development, and amendment of constituent documents);
- obtaining licenses;
- providing support during inspections by law enforcement and control bodies.

