Google Analytics, Google Ads editor, FB Business manager,
Serpstat, Snov.io, Ahrefs, SEMrush, Trello, Slack, Adobe CC,
Excel, Bitrix24, amoCRM, Zoho CRM, OpenCart, WordPress, MailChimp, Tooligram, Sendpulse, GetResponse, Smartsender,  etc.

CERTIFICATES
Google Ads, Google Analytics, Facebook / Instagram Ads, Business Analyst, amoCRM
• Worked mostly in IT companies, also in online education, business automation, digital agency, and hr-tech projects.
• Launched new projects and optimized marketing work in B2B and B2C segments.
• I have experience in creating the right key messages and promoting business online via omnichannel digital strategy.
