I specialize in marketing and advertising. For me, marketing is the art of creating relationships between businesses and customers. I can help your products find an audience and turn them into regular customers.
I am looking for a senior position, a role in digital marketing, which would allow me to help take your company to a new level by applying a set of my skills and experience. At the new work, I expect constructive tasks, a positive atmosphere in the team, and rewards regarding the result.

