•	Demonstration of strong analytical skills in risk assessment of potential clients;
•	Verification of the authenticity of documents with the help of available software and training;
•	Detection and notification of fraudulent applications, rejection of those that do not meet the agreed evaluation criteria;
•	Communicating with various departments to convey customer inquiries or customer cases that require special attention via Slack, ZenDesk, Jira.

