candidate_text:
Position: Career Consultant / Certified Coach
Moreinfo: Having 5+ years in IT recruitment, I gained experience in closing vacancies of the different tech stacks, levels, project domain areas and even for different countries. It makes me feel fluent in the Digital world and that’s why currently I’m working as a Career Consultant and Job Coach, helping Ukrainians find jobs and feel better in these hard times.

Experience working in big IT companies with a fast vacancies and candidates flow taught me to switch effectively between large amounts of tasks and get used to changes in the short term. I always strive to analyze and systematize information, find new, better, simpler, or just quicker ways of getting a result and love inspiring my clients to use the same approach.

I passed several coach courses last year, and I’m planning to get more coaching, career consulting and oratorical training this year.
Highlights: - Managed my career path change and now I feel confident at consulting clients with the same goal.
- Personal Hiring Record - 10 closed positions in 1 month;
- Successful negotiation with customers at all stages of the recruiting process, that was highly valued by management;
- More than 65% of hired candidates were Senior technical specialists, 95% of them passed the trial period;
- I love improving and polishing the things that surround me, that's why I always go beyond the basic requirements for my role in every job place. Examples are provided in the resume;
