Position: Business Analyst / Product Manager
Moreinfo: As a Product Manager I was responsible for:
- customer discovery interviews, defined target audience;
- competitor analysis, market research;
- document user stories, acceptance criteria, product requirements to support the development;
- preparing and prioritizing backlog;
- facilitating cross-functional meetings and communication between stakeholders;
- examining if the developed version of a product meets business requirements, check its usability and accuracy;
- collaborating with potential business partners as part of product monetization.

I have a business background, Master's degree in Economics. 

Before product management in IT, I worked for 5+ years in one of the largest corporate banks in Ukraine as a Risk Manager. 

I was responsible for the financial and operational analysis of business units from different industries, evaluating risks, and finding business solutions. 

I have an experience in people management (10+ co-workers) and communication with clients and representatives of business, insurance, and appraisal companies.
