candidate_text:
Position: Business Analyst, Product Manager
Moreinfo: Highly organized and  responsible with more than 5 years of experience as an Analyst, Business Analyst and Product Manager in the IT industry, looking for a position to use current skills with a view towards growth in product requirements development and management.

· Eliciting, collecting and developing requirements;
· Design a new solution to improve existing business process;
· Maintaining team with project features evaluation process, splitting high level requirements into features and user stories, generating acceptance criteria;
· Building requirements ecosystem in Confluence and Jira;
· Product Backlog maintenance and prioritization;
· Working closely with software development and testing team members to design and develop solutions to meet requirements, tasks distribution;
· Tracking change requests across product lifecycle;
· Gather and analyze data on project adoption, competitors, provision of market analysis data, business cases coverage;
· Interaction with designers, reviewing UX/UI;
· Gather, process and manage customer feedback;
· Quality control;
· Coordination of cross-department tasks;
