Position: Business Analyst
Moreinfo: •	8+ years of experience in multicultural environment with deep understanding the inter dependencies between business processes, programs and systems in order to plan, develop, and implement change;
•	Business background with experience in Telecom/FMCG/financial services-relevant industries
•	Honored MSc in Economic cybernetics;
•	2 years of experience in Salesforce.com (Administration, Configuration, Implementation & Support);
•	Competent in elicitation user requirements and converting them into software requirement specifications;
•	Experienced in delivering Portals/Communities on the Force.com platform;
•	Experience in implementation using Workflows, Process Builder, Components, Tabs, Custom Objects, Reports, and Snapshots Dashboards;
•	Experience in Service Cloud (Email-to-Case, Service Console, Live Agent, Omni-Channel);
•	Experience in Creation of Dashboards, Reports using standard Salesforce tools; 
•	Manage project scope, prioritization, work plans, project risks and issues, project schedules and milestones;
