candidate_text:
Position: Cloud/Solutions/DevOps Architect
Moreinfo: DevOps/Cloud/Solutions Architect and consultant with a strong experience in architect designing, planning, developing, automating, purchasing, securing and managing from scratch IT infrastructures based on Microsoft Azure, VMware and AWS technologies, Cisco and HP enterprise class hardware equipment with accordance to ITIL requirements.

Currently, is a Cloud Solutions Arcihtect. In this role is responsible for new architecture solutions for Azure/AWS clouds with leveraging serverless and microservices;
Kubernetes, Docker, Containers, REST APIs; 
planning, implementing and supporting CI/CD in Azure DevOps and AWS infrastructure;
Azure AD including B2C, MFA, SSO.

Before this project was a Lead DevOps/SysOps Engineer for other client. In this role managed Team of 20+ engineers;
was responsible for Network Operations Center Team activity planning, troubleshooting non-standard and complicated tasks, reliability and security supporting and improving, Public/Private Cloud architecture and migration, cost optimization, team members tutoring.

Before these, worked for other firm, in the Project System Engineer/Senior Software Engineer (DevOps) role where was responsible for modern system deployment and changing (Azure/AWS, Private Cloud, IaC, SaaS/IaaS/PaaS, Public Cloud).

Experience:
- Over 17 years of experience in system operations area;
- Over 14 years of experience with USA/EU clients;
- Over 10 years experience with High Tech Healthcare customers from USA;
- Over 6 years of team lead experience;
- Over 7 years of experience in DevOps area.

