candidate_text:
Position: CFO
Moreinfo: Summary:
Detail-oriented CFO with 7 years of experience dedicated to spearheading financial growth through careful financial planning and cost-cutting initiatives. Strong qualifications in developing and implementing financial controls and processes in addition to productivity improvements. Possesses solid leadership, communication, and interpersonal skills to establish rapport with all levels of staff and management.

Duration: Apr 2019 - Feb 2020
Role: Senior Finance Manager
Project description: Product IT-company.
Responsibilities:
- Preparation and consolidation of financial statements in QuickBooks & Fathom;  
- Financial Reporting & Budgeting, burn rate and runway calculation;
- Management of the company’s bank accounts (US, Chase);  
- US & UA Payroll management;  
- Development of the accounting policy and internal policies (equipment, business trips, FOPs, etc.) for the company; 

Duration: Dec 2016 – Mar 2019
Role: CFO
Project description: Software development company.
Responsibilities:
- the implementation of management accounting from the scratch: Balance, Cash Flow, and P&L;
- as the only financier: day-to-day cash flow management, internal reporting, all accounting and treasury activities;
- prepare financial data for USA tax and valuation advisers;
- as a member of the management team prepare data for Strategic Planning.
Looking For: Professional growth. Adequate management. Informal environment. Challenges. Interesting projects.
Highlights: Overall 10 years of Financial Management experience in different areas including Finance, Sales & E-Marketing.
Knowledge of Financial Management & Management Accounting.
MBA: Professional Diploma in Management – Dip Mgmt (Open) (2013).
Accounting Certification: Certified Accounting Practitioner – CAP (2010), CIMA – in progress (2019). 
Experience of the implementation of management accounting from the scratch: Balance, Cash Flow and P&L. Able to analytic work within the constraints of resources and time, to manage risk of projects.
English Level: upper
Experience Years: 10.0
CV: Overall 10 years of Financial Management experience in different areas including Finance, Sales & E-Marketing.
Knowledge of Financial Management & Management Accounting.
MBA: Professional Diploma in Management – Dip Mgmt (Open) (2013).
