Position: Business Analyst
Moreinfo: Working period: 10.02.2017 – 31.10.2020
Position: Financial Analyst
Organization: «Trade House Alef – Vinal» LLC
Main responsibilities:
Financial budget management
• Reservation and withdrawal of funds;
• Processing of memos on budget;
• Payroll for the trading team (control of key indicators, processing of fines / bonuses);
• Formation of acts of reconciliation;
• Consultations of budget issues.
Other:
• Performing additional tasks (ABC analysis, formulas, pivot tables);
• Writing technical specifications for the implementation of various reports;
• Writing technical specifications for the creation of VBA-applications for the automation of accounting processes and detailed reconciliation;
• Testing of the finished product;
• Prepare instructions for using updated reports / applications.

Working period: 22.02.2016 – 04.11.2016
Position: Sales Analyst
Organization: «Weight measuring systems-Service» LLC
Main responsibilities:
Work in 1C: Enterprise 8.2
• maintaining a database (customers management, creating. editing, removing information);
• database analysis (obtaining various statistics for prognosis sales, generating reports (client refusal, repeat sales, strategic fact plan);
• writing technical specifications for the modernization of reports in 1C;
• preparation of instructions for the effective use of modified reports in 1C.

Working period: 01.09.2015 – 30.11.2015
Position: Account Manager
Organization: «One Service. Implementation Center» LLC
Main responsibilities:
Work in JIRA (project and task management system):
• creating tasks for programmers;
• monitoring and control of the process of execute tasks;
• closing tasks.
Work in 1C: MT 2.0:
• formation and issue of bills for the work performed;
• monitoring of payments.
Other:
• drafting and sending letters on payments and refunds;
• receiving incoming / outgoing calls to clients;
• advising clients on the services provided by the firm.

Working period: 27.03.2014 – 29.10.2014
Position: Specialist of the Remote Customer Service
Organization: «VAB Bank» PIO
Main responsibilities:
• Advising clients about new and constant products of the Bank: 
• Deposits; 
• Card accounts;
• Loans; 
• Purchase - sale of bank metals and coins
