candidate_text:
Position: CFO, Deputy CFO, Finance Manager
Moreinfo: Accounting & Finance, legal and compliance expertise with 10 years of practice. Experience in Accounting & Finance of International legal entities. 
- Hiring, training, and motivating accounting staff members while supervising and delegating department tasks;
- Bookkeeping for international entities in different jurisdictions;
- Organization and controlling of all accounting procedures for the group of companies;
- Control compliance with tax code and regulations;
- Preparation of financial statements and other reports;
- Bookkeeping process optimization in terms of business directions;
- Management and diversification of financial flows;
- Payment execution in International payment systems;
- Communication with banks, payment service providers, and vendors regarding the payments;
- Manage relationships with external audit professionals and accounting partners;
- Support audit process for a group of companies;
- Supervising the preparation of accounting records by external international accountants;
- Budgeting committee work organization;
- Supervision of taxation structure of the group of companies;
- Agreements proofreading in accordance with financial needs of the company;
- Financial strategy development and implementation.

Achievements:  

1. Set up accounting for a newly established International legal entity.
2. Restored the accounting of the holding company from the moment of incorporation till up to date (records for 5 years) and prepared financial statements for the external audit needs.
3. Successful business restructuring in accordance with accounting procedures. 
4. Developed and implemented the company's cash flow system in accordance with accounting requirements and international Payment system processing compliance.
5. In accordance with the company's needs made research, proposed an optimal business model and as a result organized operational activities in a specific area of the economy.
6. Departments budgeting structure developed and implemented.
English Level: upper
Experience Years: 10.0
