candidate_text:
Position: Business Analyst, Marketing Analyst
Moreinfo: I am a marketer with 4+ years of experience. I can analyze the competitive environment, identify cause-and-effect relationships , predict sales of the market as a whole and competitors, predict changes in advertising indicators, and create a brand promotion and pricing strategy.

I am result-oriented, persistent, and attentive to details, I like to work with large datasets, build forecasts and models, and also learn something new, and optimize processes.

1) Data Processing Specialist, AC Nielsen:
Formation of reports for clients, their automation, and data validation;
2) Junior Communication Researcher/Communication Researcher, Universal McCann:
- Formation of reports on the advertising market (Newsletter, Media Market Overview, Magna);
Preparation of analytics for the client:
- Analytics of the client market and analysis of competitors in media and digital;
- Preparation of cases for the client, non-standard research;
- Forecasting the effectiveness of the strategy and forecasting business results (forecasts based on time series, logistic and linear regressions; analysis, comparison, and preparation of recommendations based on econometric models);
