candidate_text:
Position: Angular developer
Moreinfo: With over 8 years of experience as a web developer, I have specialized in developing isomorphic and real-time applications using Node.js and JavaScript. Additionally, I have extensive experience in backend development with Node.js. In my 5 years as a frontend developer, I have focused on utilizing Angular for developing user interfaces and Cypress for testing. I also have experience in unit testing and end-to-end testing.

As a team player, I possess strong communication and interpersonal skills. I am self-motivated and have a good understanding of OOP and design patterns. Furthermore, I am comfortable working with both technical and non-technical team members.

Recently, I worked as a full-stack developer. My skillset includes Node.js frameworks such as Express and Socket.io, HTML, CSS, Angular, and Cypress for frontend development. In addition, I have experience working with databases such as MongoDB and MySQL.
Looking For: - Professional development;
- Participate in conferences;
- Documented salary;
- New technologies and frameworks.
