candidate_text:
Position: CISO, Information security, IT specialist, Head of IT
Moreinfo: 18 years of experience in IT of which 11 years as an information security engineer and analyst and 7 years as an IT manager.
I have extensive knowledge and diverse experience to build, maintain and develop IT and/or information security in the company.

• Information Security Management;
• Management of the company's IT infrastructure;
• Performing various security-related tasks in accordance with the security procedure.
• Participation in the management of SIEM (SPLUNK)
• Creating new use cases and improving existing ones, creating
alerts and dashboards, creating reports;
• Development and debugging of security processes and
procedures;
• Ongoing Enterprise network monitoring for the purpose of
identifying security weaknesses and implementing the necessary
remediation plans
• Actively identifying security weaknesses and identifying the
necessary remediation plan;
• Work to improve and/or automate existing systems;
• Performing an analysis of security incidents and making
recommendations for remediation;
• Participation in the automation of incident prioritization and
detection;
• Act as the first line of contact for various security consultations;
 • Deploy and improving the CRM system, Telegram bots;
• Management of digital marketing (SEO, MMS, Google Ads);
• Configure and support security system: Firewalls, IDS/IPS, SIEM.
(Cisco);
• Configure routing of local networks (Cisco);
• Deploying monitoring system (Zabbix, Cacti);
• Setup and administration Antivirus (McAfee, ESET), DLP;
• Enterprise-grade server support (Windows, FreeBSD);
• Administration of the CCTV;
