candidate_text:
Position: CIO/CTO/IT manager / Tech lead / DevOps / Infra architect
Moreinfo: More than 20 years of experience. Mostly Linux and Networks
Deep infra knowledge:
* Networking from Campus LAN to nation-wide MPLS, IPv6 networks, BGP, OSPF, RIPE, DMVPN, NGFW/NGIPS;
* SAN FC & iSCSI networks;
