Deep understanding of SDLC processes and development methodologies;
Implementation and support of Agile culture in the team;
Evaluation of projects, understanding of the client's needs, proposals of realistic and effective solutions, both for the client and for the company;
The ability to see promising and non-promising projects;
Ability to grow personnel, personal mentoring;
Ability to explain complex technical issues in simple words, critical analysis of projects and decomposition into understandable tasks, analysis of customer tasks before starting work;
Strong problem solving skills and attention to detail;
Preparation of technical documentation and road maps for the team;
Ensuring consistency of technical projects with the company's business goals.

Skills:
Business and planning: Financial planning, Strategic planning · Business development;
Leadership and team management: JIRA, Asana, Agile, SDLC, Lean, CI/CD, TOC, Scrum, LeSS, Kanban, WBS, DISC, RACI;
Infrastructure: Linux Server, Windows Server, GCP, AWS, Azure, VMware, KVM, Docker, Microservices, Zabbix;
Databases: MongoDB, MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite;
Testing: BrowserStack, Selenium, PHPUnit, Protractor, Karma;
Security: PCI DSS, OWASP, SAST, DAST;
Other: Linux, Nginx, Apache, PHP, SOLID, OOD/OOP, Patterns, Yii2, Laravel, Symfony, REST API, SQL, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, SASS/SCSS, Less, Bootstrap, jQuery, React, Vue.js.

